    "chunk_text": "ma secgan buton swa hit w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t he ne mihte n\u00e6fre of his reste arisan, \u00fe\u00e6t he Ac \u00feysum w\u00e6s \u00e6t his moder & his bro\u00feer to \u00feegnienne, & swa hw\u00e6t swa hi onfon mihte & Ne cu\u00fee he n\u00e6nige bocstafas, ac swa \u00feeah he gebohte him sylfum \u00fea bec \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gewrites, \u00dea \u00e6t nehstan w\u00e6s hit geworden, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6fter gemete fullmedomlice geleornode \u00fe\u00e6t halige & he \u00fea \u00e6t nehstan ongan in \u00feam sare symble secgan Gode \u00feancas, mid ymnum & herenessum Ac \u00fea \u00fea eallunga seo tid neal\u00e6hte, \u00fe\u00e6t him sceolde beon geleanod his swa mycelre \u00ferowunge & & \u00fea \u00fea he ong\u00e6t eallinga, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s neah his dea\u00f0e, he b\u00e6d \u00fea \u00e6l\u00feeodigan weras & eac \u00fea & he \u00fea eac sylfa swa sweltende mid \u00feam o\u00ferum bro\u00f0rum sang his sealmas. \u00dea f\u00e6ringa styrde he \u00feam stefnum \u00feara singendra & mid fyrhte mycelre clypunge \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Cwe\u00fee ge, \u00fe\u00e6t ge ne hyran, hu manige dreamas & lofsangas nu hleo\u00feria\u00fe in heofonum? & \u00fea \u00fea he to \u00feam ylcan lofsangum, \u00fee he in his mode gehyrde, a\u00feenede & gebigde his heortan \u00dea witodlice ut gangendre \u00fe\u00e6re sawle of \u00feam lichaman \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00f0 swa mycclu wynsumnes \u00fe\u00e6s & \u00fea \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t ong\u00e6ton hi openlice, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea sawle \u00fea englas underfeng",
